   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 355.15,
   "dur": 3.06,
   "speech": "先看 ADF 在测什么。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 358.76,
   "dur": 3.47,
   "speech": "它测的是：序列里有没有单位根。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 362.78,
   "dur": 2.37,
   "speech": "单位根是什么意思？"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 365.7,
   "dur": 4.77,
   "speech": "意思是今天的值，几乎就是昨天的值加噪声。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 371.01,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "这样的序列，冲击永远不会消失。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 375.13,
   "dur": 3.13,
   "speech": "所以它没有可以回去的均值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 378.81,
   "dur": 4.09,
   "speech": "ADF 的做法，是回归一个系数 gamma。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 383.46,
   "dur": 3.33,
   "speech": "如果 gamma 等于零，就有单位根。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 387.33,
   "dur": 3.54,
   "speech": "tau 就是 gamma 除以它的标准误。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 391.42,
   "dur": 4.05,
   "speech": "关键在分母：这个比值不服从 t 分布。"
  },
