   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 407.12,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speech": "名字叫漂移，但它测的不是漂移。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 411.43,
   "dur": 3.9,
   "speech": "它的做法：在序列上画九条水平线。"
  },
