   "start": 439.22,
   "dur": 3.18,
   "speech": "再拿一条单边上涨的直线试。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 442.95,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speech": "结果还是零点五。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 445.82,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speech": "因为中位数，总落在正中间。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 449.65,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speech": "所以这个数只说明形状对称。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 453.72,
   "dur": 4.12,
   "speech": "不说明有没有漂移，也不说明漂移多强。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 458.38,
   "dur": 2.68,
   "speech": "第三个指标，转移性。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 461.61,
   "dur": 2.61,
   "speech": "它的做法，分三步。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 464.77,
   "dur": 3.37,
   "speech": "第一步，把序列分成三个状态。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 468.69,
   "dur": 4.89,
   "speech": "第二步，数状态之间的转移，得到一个三乘三矩阵。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 474.13,
   "dur": 4.57,
   "speech": "第三步，每行除以这一行的和，得到概率矩阵。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 479.25,
   "dur": 3.42,
   "speech": "对这个矩阵的三个列，算方差。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 483.22,
   "dur": 3.3,
   "speech": "三个方差加起来，就是转移性。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 487.08,
   "dur": 2.97,
   "speech": "拿完美周期一二三来试。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 490.59,
   "dur": 3.66,
   "speech": "每一行只有一格是一，其余是零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 494.8,
   "dur": 3.4,
   "speech": "三行的列方差，各是九分之二。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 498.75,
   "dur": 2.46,
   "speech": "加起来，三分之二。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 501.76,
   "dur": 2.61,
   "speech": "再拿常数序列来试。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 40,
   "start": 504.92,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speech": "它只有一个状态，只有第一行非零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 41,
   "start": 508.99,
   "dur": 2.7,
   "speech": "另外两行，全是零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 42,
   "start": 512.24,
   "dur": 4.05,
   "speech": "列方差各是九分之一，加起来九分之二。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 43,
   "start": 516.84,
   "dur": 2.73,
   "speech": "一个在动，一个不动。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 44,
   "start": 520.11,
   "dur": 3.35,
   "speech": "动的那个数大，不动的那个数小。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 45,
   "start": 524.01,
   "dur": 3.49,
   "speech": "所以它测的是动力学的确定性。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 46,
   "start": 528.06,
   "dur": 2.7,
   "speech": "不是停在原状态的概率。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 47,
   "start": 531.31,
   "dur": 2.75,
   "speech": "三个指标，三句话。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 48,
   "start": 534.61,
   "dur": 2.73,
   "speech": "ADF：有没有单位根。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 49,
   "start": 537.88,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "漂移性：上分位中位数的形状。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 50,
   "start": 541.69,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "转移性：状态转移有多确定。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 548.34,
   "dur": 2.99,
   "speech": "三个算法，三条签名。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 551.88,
   "dur": 2.51,
   "speech": "第一条，ADF。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 554.94,
   "dur": 4.43,
   "speech": "输入是配置和一条序列，输出 Either 和结果。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 559.92,
   "dur": 2.63,
   "speech": "配置里有三样东西。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 563.1,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speech": "回归型：无常数、仅常数、带趋势。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 567.89,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "滞后阶：可以给，也可以交给规则。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 572,
   "dur": 4.41,
   "speech": "显著性水平：只接受百分之一、五、十。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 576.96,
   "dur": 4.14,
   "speech": "结果里有 tau，有标准误，有三个临界值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 581.65,
   "dur": 3.4,
   "speech": "还有一个布尔值：平稳还是不平稳。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 585.6,
   "dur": 3.59,
   "speech": "判决不藏在注释里，写在类型里。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 589.74,
   "dur": 2.37,
   "speech": "第二条，漂移性。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 592.66,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "输入一个整数 m，一条序列。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 596.46,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "输出一个数，或者一个错误。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 600.17,
   "dur": 2.65,
   "speech": "m 是阈值线的条数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 603.37,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speech": "书里没给默认值，我们演示用九。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 607.44,
   "dur": 3.37,
   "speech": "工程上可以用二十，结论会变。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 611.36,
   "dur": 2.46,
   "speech": "第三条，转移性。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 614.38,
   "dur": 3.18,
   "speech": "输入状态数 k，一条序列。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 618.11,
   "dur": 3.18,
   "speech": "输出指标值，还有一个矩阵。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 621.84,
   "dur": 3.09,
   "speech": "矩阵是三乘三的转移概率。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 625.48,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "书中固定三个符号，这里用 k 表示。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 629.76,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "三条签名，三张错误表。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 633.47,
   "dur": 3.23,
   "speech": "ADF 这一条，有五种失败。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 637.25,
   "dur": 4.09,
   "speech": "序列太短，有非有限值，滞后不合法。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 641.89,
   "dur": 4.69,
   "speech": "显著性水平不在三档里，或者设计矩阵秩亏。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 647.14,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "漂移性那一条，有四种失败。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 650.84,
   "dur": 5.13,
   "speech": "m 太小，序列太短，有非有限值，或者序列退化。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 656.52,
   "dur": 3.61,
   "speech": "退化的意思是：整条序列是常数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 660.68,
   "dur": 3.23,
   "speech": "转移性那一条，有三种失败。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 664.46,
   "dur": 4.19,
   "speech": "状态数太小，序列太短，有非有限值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 669.2,
   "dur": 4.07,
   "speech": "加起来十二种失败，每一种都有一条测试。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 673.82,
   "dur": 3.4,
   "speech": "没有一种是靠运行时崩出来的。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 677.77,
   "dur": 3.3,
   "speech": "这是这三条签名的共同约定。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 681.62,
   "dur": 3.59,
   "speech": "错误用 Either 返回，不抛异常。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 685.76,
   "dur": 3.85,
   "speech": "调用方必须处理，不能假装看不见。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 690.17,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speech": "画面后面每出现一个数字。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 693.76,
   "dur": 4.43,
   "speech": "它要么对应一个错误分支，要么对应一条检查。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 698.74,
   "dur": 3.09,
   "speech": "三种算法都只做一件事。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 702.37,
   "dur": 3.13,
   "speech": "把一条序列，压成一个数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 706.06,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "压之前是什么，压之后还剩什么。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 40,
   "start": 710.17,
   "dur": 3.93,
   "speech": "这中间的损失，就是后面要讲的事。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 0,
   "start": 717.5,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "先说实现，三种算法三种做法。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 1,
   "start": 721.78,
   "dur": 2.7,
   "speech": "先看 ADF 的回归。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 2,
   "start": 725.04,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speech": "被解释变量，是序列的差分。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 3,
   "start": 728.86,
   "dur": 3.64,
   "speech": "解释变量，是滞后一期的水平值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 4,
   "start": 733.05,
   "dur": 4.07,
   "speech": "再加上滞后差分项，用来吸收自相关。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 5,
   "start": 737.67,
   "dur": 3.69,
   "speech": "滞后几阶？书里没给规则。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 6,
   "start": 741.91,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speech": "我们用 Schwert 规则。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 7,
   "start": 744.78,
   "dur": 4.38,
   "speech": "十二乘以样本量除以一百的四分之一次方。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 8,
   "start": 749.71,
   "dur": 2.87,
   "speech": "这个数，再向下取整。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 9,
   "start": 753.13,
   "dur": 3.69,
   "speech": "250 个点，算出来滞后 15 阶。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 10,
   "start": 757.36,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speech": "有效观测，234 个。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 760.95,
   "dur": 2.53,
   "speech": "系数用什么方法解？"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 764.04,
   "dur": 2.77,
   "speech": "这里有一个很容易踩的坑。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 767.36,
   "dur": 4.19,
   "speech": "价格量级是一千，方差量级是一百万。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 772.1,
   "dur": 3.35,
   "speech": "正规方程会把条件数平方。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 776,
   "dur": 3.49,
   "speech": "条件数一变大，系数就不稳。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 780.04,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speech": "所以我们用 Householder QR。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 783.87,
   "dur": 4.93,
   "speech": "不组正规方程，直接对设计矩阵做正交变换。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 789.36,
   "dur": 4.07,
   "speech": "残差平方和，从变换后的向量取。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 793.98,
   "dur": 3.35,
   "speech": "标准误，从 R 的对角线取。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 797.88,
   "dur": 3.3,
   "speech": "tau 就是系数除以标准误。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 801.73,
   "dur": 2.7,
   "speech": "第二个坑，常数序列。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 804.98,
   "dur": 3.4,
   "speech": "差分全零，水平值是常数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 808.93,
   "dur": 3.23,
   "speech": "设计矩阵秩亏，解不出来。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 812.71,
   "dur": 3.42,
   "speech": "我们不返回 NaN，也不静默给零。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 816.68,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speech": "我们返回一个专门的错误。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 820.03,
   "dur": 2.75,
   "speech": "第二种，漂移性的实现。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 823.33,
   "dur": 2.53,
   "speech": "九条线，等距画。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 826.41,
   "dur": 2.92,
   "speech": "每条线以上，取中位数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 829.88,
   "dur": 3.09,
   "speech": "线本身不参与中位数计算。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 833.52,
   "dur": 2.94,
   "speech": "只有严格大于线的点才算。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 837.01,
   "dur": 2.92,
   "speech": "然后归一化九个中位数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 840.48,
   "dur": 4.14,
   "speech": "归一化区间，用这九个数自己的范围。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 845.17,
   "dur": 2.68,
   "speech": "这一步最容易换口径。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 848.4,
   "dur": 3.54,
   "speech": "换成原序列的范围，数就变了。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 852.49,
   "dur": 3.61,
   "speech": "所以这一条，写进了自授权文件。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 856.65,
   "dur": 3.01,
   "speech": "第三种，转移性的实现。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 860.22,
   "dur": 2.85,
   "speech": "分箱是最容易漏的一步。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 863.61,
   "dur": 2.99,
   "speech": "等宽分三格，用 floor。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 867.15,
   "dur": 3.59,
   "speech": "最大值那一格，floor 会算出三。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 40,
   "start": 871.29,
   "dur": 2.7,
   "speech": "必须把它夹回第二格。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 41,
   "start": 874.54,
   "dur": 4.6,
   "speech": "漏了这个 clamp，最后一点就落到不存在的状态。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 42,
   "start": 879.69,
   "dur": 2.99,
   "speech": "然后数转移，行归一化。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 43,
   "start": 883.23,
   "dur": 3.23,
   "speech": "零行保持零行，不补均匀。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
   "index": 44,
   "start": 887.01,
   "dur": 3.09,
   "speech": "最后算列方差，除以三。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "implementation",
